      "readMe": "# Grade Scale\n\n## Summary\nBands (letter, minPct); `letterFor(pct, scale)` and `letterAtLeast()`. Defaults to A–F at 90/80/70/60.\n\n## Usage\nOn Course; read by Grade Submission, Learner Progress, Gradebook.\n\n## Non-goals\nNo GPA arithmetic.\n\n## Example\nThe contained example is the default A–F scale. A course can replace it with its own bands, such as pass/merit/distinction.",
